{"id": "86219", "name": "פירוק לגורמים – הפרש ריבועים עם שבר x² − y²/4 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Factorise the following:\n\\[ {{CT:0}} .\\] <br>\n[[input:ans]] [[validation:ans]]", "generalfeedback": "When factorising this expression, it is convenient to notice that it is the difference of two squares. The general rule for the differece of two squares is \\(a^2-b^2 = (a-b)(a+b)\\). <br>\n<br>\nIn this example, notice that:\n\\[ a^2 = {{CT:1}}. \\]\n\\[ b^2 = {{CT:2}}. \\]\nTherefore:\n\\[ a = {{CT:3}}. \\]\n\\[ b = {{CT:4}}. \\]\nNow, substituting these back into \\((a-b)(a+b)\\) and removing any constant factors, we obtain:\n\\[ {{CT:5}} .\\]", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "FacForm", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "x", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta"], "nvariants": 1}